cff-version: 1.2.0
title: fixed-income-engine
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Lyonn
    family-names: Lie
    alias: leeyawnnn
repository-code: "https://github.com/leeyawnnn/fixed_income_engine"
abstract: >-
  A C++20 fixed income analytics library: yield curve bootstrapping from market
  instruments under three interpolation schemes, Nelson-Siegel-Svensson curve
  fitting, interest rate swap valuation with separate discount and projection
  curves, and rate risk including duration, convexity, DV01, key-rate DV01 and
  bucketed hedging. Validated against published US Treasury par yield curve
  rates.
keywords:
  - fixed-income
  - yield-curve
  - bootstrapping
  - interest-rate-swaps
  - nelson-siegel
  - quantitative-finance
  - cpp20
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
